# Build context for the streaming, admin and chat images (docker-compose.yml and the Jenkinsfile use ./backend).
# Each image runs its own npm install; local node_modules (installed on Windows by npm ci for the unit
# tests) must not be sent - they made the context upload fail and would overwrite the image's Linux modules.
**/node_modules
**/npm-debug.log
**/*.log
**/.env
**/coverage
**/__tests__
**/logs
**/tmp-uploads
streamingService/videos
streamingService/controllers/*.mp4
